    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, Ravi Karunanayake,Finance Minister of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respect of the commodity itemsspecified in \u201cColumn I\u201d of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy, at the rates specified in the corresponding entriesin Column II of that Schedule. This order shall be valid for a period of 04 months commencing from 17th June 2015, subject toprovisions of Sub-section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
    "fonts": [
